},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり自分で言うのもなんだけど、顔はちょっと大人っぽくなったよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クククッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長エピソード"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドーム見に来てくれたお母さんから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛をの歌の時、歩き方がおかしかったね  って言われたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いた方いたかな～⁉︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は狼に口笛をの時の衣装なんだけど、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの当時のままの衣装と靴なの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから背が伸びてるし、足もsize変わってるからなの‥‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服の丈が短いし、靴の中は指曲げて履いてて大変な事になってるの‥‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから歩きにくかったなぁ～‥(๑⃙⃘•ㅅ•๑⃙⃘)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当時の衣装を着ると、中学1年～高校1年生で成長したんだな～って思います。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のアンダー曲はもう聞いてくれたかな？センターは、めいちゃん（中元日芽香）だよ～^o^わ～い！*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEもあるし、来て良かった～！\nまた来たい！って思ってもらえるように頑張ります‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、メンバーやスタッフさんダンスの先生に\nファンの方からもダンスを褒めてもらう事が増えたので、もっと楽しんでもらえるようにレッスンも頑張ります！！\n見にきてね(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校は小テストが多くて大変‥\nもうすぐ期末テストだ‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｲｼﾞｲｼﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生の皆さん！一緒に頑張ろう～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(๑•̀o•́๑)۶ FIGHT☆ͦ\n＼_(･ω･`)ｺｺ重要!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方 飽きてきたから気分を変えようと思って\n家族とテレビ電話で日本史のクイズ大会したよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではここで皆んさんに問題！世界史です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前367年コンスルの１名を平民から選出する方法をなんと言うでしょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/01/1134954/0027.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おんざまゆげちゃん‥あはっ(*´ω(ω`ｏ ))) ﾁｭｯ♪(❁ᴗ͈ˬᴗ͈)◞ƶƶz"}],"source":"archive"}